## 🚀 QUICK SETUP STEPS

### Step 1: Replace Core Files
```bash
cd your-smartclinic-project

# Backup originals
cp app.py app_old.py
cp database.py database_old.py

# Copy new files
# (Copy the app.py I just created - NOT app_enhanced.py)
# (Copy the database.py I created earlier)
# (Copy config.py - optional)
```

### Step 2: Update Requirements
```bash
# Copy new requirements
cp requirements_enhanced.txt requirements.txt

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Step 3: Setup Environment
```bash
# Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env

# Edit .env and add your values:
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_key
# SECRET_KEY=your_secret
# etc.
```

### Step 4: Copy New Templates
```bash
# From the templates folder, add these files:
# - 404.html
# - 500.html
# - patient_profile.html
# - doctor_prescriptions.html
# - base.html (UPDATED - replace old one)
```

### Step 5: Clean Database (Fresh Start)
```bash
# Remove old database
rm smartclinic.db

# Start the app - it will create new database with proper schema
python app.py
```

